{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42231","headline":"邵伯埭下寄高邮陈郎中 · 徐铉","name":"邵伯埭下寄高邮陈郎中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"故人相别动经年，候馆相逢倍惨然。\n顾我饮冰难辍櫂，感君扶病爲开筵。\n河湾水浅翘秋鹭，柳岸风微噪暮蝉。\n欲识酒醒魂断处，谢公祠畔客亭前。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42231.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42231","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}